From b4001472f7fe33364458738de74a3f78fc840007 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 16:52:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] MAINTAINERS: add the hix5hd2 IR receiver entry

The hix5hd2 infrared receiver has no maintainer entry. The driver is a
media-rc driver of this family.

Register the driver with the binding that describes it under
linux-media.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
---
 MAINTAINERS | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

--- a/MAINTAINERS
+++ b/MAINTAINERS
@@ -12062,6 +12062,13 @@ S:	Supported
 F:	Documentation/admin-guide/perf/hns3-pmu.rst
 F:	drivers/perf/hisilicon/hns3_pmu.c
 
+HISILICON HIX5HD2 INFRARED RECEIVER DRIVER
+M:	David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
+L:	linux-media@vger.kernel.org
+S:	Maintained
+F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/hisilicon,hix5hd2-ir.yaml
+F:	drivers/media/rc/ir-hix5hd2.c
+
 HISILICON I2C CONTROLLER DRIVER
 M:	Devyn Liu <liudingyuan@h-partners.com>
 L:	linux-i2c@vger.kernel.org
